      <p><seg source="#source-7088-7100">（二）　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7100-7127"><rb>投者</rb><rt>ピッチャー</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7127-7138">の位置</seg></p>
